await test('ルーム作成の通信失敗を再送せず、開始前にも安全な記録を残す',async()=>{const values=new Map(),diary=new ConnectionDiary({getItem:k=>values.get(k),setItem:(k,v)=>values.set(k,v)});let calls=0;await assert.rejects(()=>requestJson('https://api.example/rooms?key=secret',{method:'POST',headers:{Authorization:'Bearer secret'},body:'private speech'},{fetcher:async()=>{calls++;throw new TypeError('Failed to fetch secret');},operation:'room_create',onFailure:value=>diary.add(value)}),error=>error.connectionIssue&&error.connection.code==='network_or_cors');assert.equal(calls,1);assert.equal(diary.list()[0].operation,'room_create');const stored=JSON.stringify(diary.list());assert.ok(!stored.includes('secret'));assert.ok(!stored.includes('private speech'));assert.equal(diary.list()[0].endpoint,'https://api.example');});
